message: "If you reference this framework in research or a write-up, please cite it as below."
title: "SoccerDream Expert Team: a multi-agent framework with an enforced disagreement protocol"
abstract: >
  A source-available framework for multi-agent analysis in which members reason
  independently, conflicting claims are escalated rather than averaged, and an
  adversarial review stage may overturn the team's conclusion before publication.
type: software
